<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-04T06:46:23.635Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 06:46:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Uganda is accelerating its pullout of African Union peacekeeping troops from Somalia and Ethiopia is also planning to withdraw its forces as fighting intensifies. The United States and an East African nation have begun joint airstrikes against an al-Qaeda-linked group, while the UAE carried out its first drone strike against al-Shabaab in nearly a year. Puntland mercenaries are fighting alongside Sudanese RSF forces and the Sudanese army reports northern Somali fighters supporting the RSF. Somali pirates seized an Iranian fishing vessel and rescued seven Pakistani crew members, and a Somali police officer was killed by an aircraft propeller, according to reports, and there were 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5OLTVsNnI2UzI5b2RxaXRoc3g0ZWU4bXhYSzliS3FPWUc5a0VCbmR1cnhWNXRPN0JsUlU2QmZGWXBIblQ2bUFOTGpVdUdNY0phYlgyU1piRHN4Q0c0N0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTFB3THptSmNxX2hscTZwT3BfQVVZelBmTldvaVVFYzNsc0dISjVLZUZ1UUh3bGF3aVhmTWdYUlh1SnNSMWFKdjlqVVdkQ3Zfbm1nMG82UDJ1ODNBMDVkZWtSVFBfRnlzdmZmN29GckJtUUtzN0FOdzRF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chronicle NG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxObWtlU2xPWFhyWGdrTnFQcHlxazgwUlltV2swU2pEM2V3NTNZSW1FWUU0Y1hRZDBRMjJMV05Bd0JzVHJZQnk2bDR1djczdU40UUxtcVNLcFdha3RkYmVDTklqVFF6dlJpZXcwZ0F3RkdWTDhLM1cxT0EzalNRb2dhVUlDcUxGdDNEUkpPVEpZVi05UlJiMjc0Mg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPem9FRElseUF6YmVWSVk0UGNCSEhTVWNWejVlMjlLMVJjdVZPS3lGOGwwVmRhOVF6R013emZUQ1YwRW5qVUp6bkpOVUg0ZXBUM2FobkpWNU1CREdISGJrT2lqYm1OeFZEaklSZXUwWXlWVlV6eWcxRXVwMVFUME5jVg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pun